recommendation:
To fix the truncation, add `text-overflow: ellipsis;` and `white-space: nowrap;` to the `li` elements within the `.header--signedin` class. This will ensure that long text is truncated with an ellipsis, maintaining a consistent appearance even with longer names.

```css
.header--signedin li {
  /* Existing styles... */
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
  overflow: hidden; /* Important for ellipsis to work */
}
```

Additionally, to prevent extremely long names from breaking the layout, you could also add `max-width: 200px;` to the `.header--signedin li` style, or adjust as needed, to provide a reasonable width limit.
